{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41802","headline":"海上从事秋日书怀 · 李中","name":"海上从事秋日书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠旅宦役尘埃，旧业那堪信未回。\n千里梦随残月断，一声蝉送早秋来。\n壶倾浊酒终难醉，匣锁青萍久不开。\n唯有搜吟遣怀抱，凉风时复上高台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}